---
interface VisionCard {
  title: string;
  body: string;
  tag: string;
}

interface Props {
  cards: VisionCard[];
}

const { cards } = Astro.props;
---

<section id="vision" class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 pt-20 pb-16">
  <div class="text-center mb-12">
    <div class="inline text-xs font-bold tracking-[2px] text-cyan-400 mb-3">WHAT YOU CAN BUILD</div>
    <h2 class="section-header tracking-tighter">The definitive HVAC platform<br>starts with this domain.</h2>
    <p class="max-w-lg mx-auto mt-4 text-slate-400">hvac.contact is the perfect foundation for category-defining products in the HVAC space.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
    {cards.map((card) => (
      <div class="group bg-slate-900 border border-white/10 hover:border-cyan-400/30 transition-colors rounded-3xl p-8 flex flex-col">
        <div class="mb-auto">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-11 h-11 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-400 to-teal-400 text-slate-950 mb-6">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-star text-xl"></i>
          </div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-2xl tracking-tight mb-3">{card.title}</h4>
          <p class="text-slate-400">{card.body}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-6 mt-auto text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-cyan-400 font-medium">{card.tag}</div>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <div class="mt-8 text-center text-xs text-slate-500 max-w-md mx-auto">
    Any of these models (or a powerful combination) can be built on hvac.contact and scaled into a category-defining, high-value business.
  </div>
</section>
